            "2116979459626840226"
          ],
          "id": "2116979459626840226",
          "text": "TAIWAN ACCUSED CHINA OF HARASSMENT AFTER A CHINESE COAST GUARD VESSEL ENTERED RESTRICTED WATERS NEAR THE PRATAS ISLANDS IN THE SOUTH CHINA SEA ON SATURDAY. TAIWANESE AND CHINESE SHIPS CAME WITHIN ONE NAUTICAL MILE OF EACH OTHER DURING THE STANDOFF, BEFORE TAIPEI DEMANDED THAT",
