          "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:29:28.000Z",
          "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
            "2116975933378998670"
          ],
          "id": "2116975933378998670",
          "text": "ISRAEL’S ELECTION CHIEF NOAM SOHLBERG SAYS THE ELECTION RESULTS WILL STAND DESPITE SERIOUS SUSPICIONS OF FOREIGN FUNDING AIMED AT INFLUENCING THE VOTE\n\nIN A JOINT STATEMENT WITH ATTORNEY GENERAL GALI BAHARAV-MIARA AND SHIN BET CHIEF DAVID ZINI, SOHLBERG SAID THE ALLEGATIONS WERE",
          "url": "https://x.com/FirstSquawk/status/2116975933378998670"
        },
        {
          "author_id": "3295423333",
          "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:29:06.000Z",
          "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
            "2116975842392002867"
          ],
          "id": "2116975842392002867",
          "text": "ALTA, WHICH FACILITATED RUSSIAN FINANCIAL TRANSACTIONS FOLLOWING MOSCOW’S 2022 INVASION OF UKRAINE AND HAD PREVIOUSLY FACED SCRUTINY FROM THE ECB, IS NOW THE SUBJECT OF CALLS FROM SERBIAN PROSECUTORS AND THE INCOMING STUDENT-LED MOVEMENT FOR AN INVESTIGATION INTO ITS OPERATIONS",
          "url": "https://x.com/FirstSquawk/status/2116975842392002867"
        },
        {
          "author_id": "3295423333",
          "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:29:04.000Z",
          "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
            "2116975829867773954"
          ],
          "id": "2116975829867773954",
          "text": "SERBIA’S CENTRAL BANK HAS SHUT DOWN ALTA BANK, A LENDER POPULAR AMONG RUSSIANS, OVER DETERIORATING FINANCES AND SUSPECTED MONEY LAUNDERING, WITH THE MOVE COMING DAYS AFTER ALEKSANDAR VUCIC’S ELECTION DEFEAT AND AMID REPORTS OF LARGE WITHDRAWALS AND TRANSFERS ABROAD - FT",
          "url": "https://x.com/FirstSquawk/status/2116975829867773954"
