        {
          "author_id": "3295423333",
          "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:28:47.000Z",
          "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
            "2116975758795255839"
          ],
          "id": "2116975758795255839",
          "text": "THE QATARI LNG CARRIER AL MAYEDA, BOUND FOR PAKISTAN, WAS STRUCK BY PROJECTILES IN THE GULF, WITH BLOOMBERG REPORTING IRAN HAD CLEARED THE VOYAGE HOURS EARLIER AND NO ONE HAVING CLAIMED THE ATTACK",
